#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:2
msgid "Quantum Reservoirs"
msgstr "Reservorios cuánticos"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.QuantumReservoir` "
"functional executes a reservoir pipeline over a sequence of inputs. Each "
"layer applies an optional pre-processing circuit, a reservoir dynamics "
"block, and an optional post-processing circuit, followed by measurements "
"of one or more observables. The dynamics block can be either analog (a "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.schedule.Schedule`) or digital (a "
":class:`~qilisdk.digital.circuit.Circuit`), so analog and digital "
"reservoirs can be benchmarked against each other with the same code. The "
"optional ``qubits_to_reset`` list can be used to reset selected qubits "
"between layers."
msgstr ""
"El funcional "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.QuantumReservoir` ejecuta"
" un pipeline de reservoir sobre una secuencia de entradas. Cada capa "
"aplica un circuito de preprocesamiento opcional, un bloque de dinámica "
"del reservoir y un circuito de postprocesamiento opcional, seguido de "
"mediciones de uno o más observables. El bloque de dinámica puede ser "
"analógico (un :class:`~qilisdk.analog.schedule.Schedule`) o digital (un "
":class:`~qilisdk.digital.circuit.Circuit`), de modo que los reservoirs "
"analógicos y digitales se pueden comparar entre sí con el mismo código. "
"La lista opcional ``qubits_to_reset`` puede utilizarse para restablecer "
"qubits seleccionados entre capas."

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:10
msgid ""
"The reservoir inputs are represented using "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirInput` "
"parameters. These behave like standard "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.variables.Parameter` objects but are marked as non-"
"trainable so they can be driven by input data sequences rather than "
"optimization loops."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas del reservoir se representan mediante parámetros "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirInput`. Estos se"
" comportan como objetos :class:`~qilisdk.core.variables.Parameter` "
"estándar, pero están marcados como no entrenables para que puedan ser "
"dirigidos por secuencias de datos de entrada en lugar de bucles de "
"optimización."

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:14
msgid "**Parameters**"
msgstr "**Parámetros**"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:16
msgid ""
"**initial_state** (:class:`~qilisdk.core.qtensor.QTensor`): Initial state"
" of the reservoir."
msgstr ""
"**initial_state** (:class:`~qilisdk.core.qtensor.QTensor`): Estado "
"inicial del reservoir."

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:17
msgid ""
"**reservoir_layer** "
"(:class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirLayer`): "
"Defines pre/post-processing, reservoir dynamics, observables, and reset "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"**reservoir_layer** "
"(:class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirLayer`): Define"
" el preprocesamiento/postprocesamiento, la dinámica del reservoir, los "
"observables y la política de restablecimiento."

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:19
msgid ""
"**input_per_layer** (List[Dict[str, float]]): Input values to apply at "
"each layer, keyed by input parameter names (typically the labels of "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirInput`)."
msgstr ""
"**input_per_layer** (List[Dict[str, float]]): Valores de entrada a "
"aplicar en cada capa, indexados por nombres de parámetros de entrada "
"(normalmente las etiquetas de "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirInput`)."

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:22
msgid "**Returns**"
msgstr "**Retorna**"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:24
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.functional_result.FunctionalResult`: Access "
"per-layer expectation values via "
":meth:`~qilisdk.functionals.functional_result.FunctionalResult.get_expectation_values`,"
" plus optional states via "
":meth:`~qilisdk.functionals.functional_result.FunctionalResult.get_intermediate_states`"
" if state tomography was requested in the readout spec."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.functional_result.FunctionalResult`: Accede "
"a los valores esperados por capa mediante "
":meth:`~qilisdk.functionals.functional_result.FunctionalResult.get_expectation_values`,"
" más estados opcionales mediante "
":meth:`~qilisdk.functionals.functional_result.FunctionalResult.get_intermediate_states`"
" si se solicitó tomografía de estado en la especificación de lectura."

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:29
msgid "Usage Example"
msgstr "Ejemplo de uso"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:72
msgid "Encoding Input Data"
msgstr "Codificación de datos de entrada"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:74
msgid ""
"You can inject classical data into a reservoir layer in multiple places. "
"The only requirement is that the keys in ``input_per_layer`` match the "
"labels of the "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirInput` objects "
"you place in the layer."
msgstr ""
"Se pueden inyectar datos clásicos en una capa del reservoir en múltiples "
"lugares. El único requisito es que las claves en ``input_per_layer`` "
"coincidan con las etiquetas de los objetos "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirInput` que se "
"colocan en la capa."

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:79
msgid "1. Encode with input and output circuits"
msgstr "1. Codificar con circuitos de entrada y salida"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:117
msgid "2. Encode directly in Hamiltonian parameters"
msgstr "2. Codificar directamente en los parámetros del Hamiltoniano"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:149
msgid "3. Encode in the schedule profile and duration"
msgstr "3. Codificar en el perfil y la duración del schedule"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:186
msgid "Digital Reservoir Dynamics"
msgstr "Dinámica de reservoir digital"

#: ../../modules/functionals/functionals_reservoirs.rst:188
msgid ""
"To drive the reservoir with a gate-based circuit instead of an analog "
"schedule, pass a :class:`~qilisdk.digital.circuit.Circuit` as "
"``evolution_dynamics``. Unlike the input and output encodings, the "
"dynamics circuit may contain multi-qubit gates, but it can't contain "
"measurements. Input data can be injected directly into the gate "
"parameters with "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirInput`."
msgstr ""
"Para impulsar el reservoir con un circuito de puertas en lugar de un "
"schedule analógico, pase un :class:`~qilisdk.digital.circuit.Circuit` "
"como ``evolution_dynamics``. A diferencia de las codificaciones de "
"entrada y salida, el circuito de dinámica puede contener puertas de "
"varios qubits, pero no puede contener mediciones. Los datos de entrada se"
" pueden inyectar directamente en los parámetros de las puertas mediante "
":class:`~qilisdk.functionals.quantum_reservoirs.ReservoirInput`."

